Important: Why are the grades incomplete?
Your table shows low accumulated scores, but the final grades are blank and the statuses are Incomplete. That is appropriate if required assessments—such as the midterm or final exam—have not yet been entered.
The system should calculate the final grade only when all required marks are available. A withdrawn student should retain the W grade without being treated as an ordinary incomplete student.




