3. How the system should work
1. 2026 — First Semester: The administrator opens registration. The student selects Regular (Café) or Non-Regular (Non-Café) and submits the registration.
2. 2026 — Second Semester: The administrator opens a new registration period. The same student must submit a new registration, even if they registered in the first semester.
3. 2027 — First Semester: The process repeats for the new academic year. Previous registration records remain saved.








